{"id":"17H","title":"Lust and Carnal Nature of Man","part":{"n":17,"title":"Personal character traits"},"url":"/law/17-personal-character-traits/17h","entries":[{"id":"17H.1","text":"Abstain from lusts and from following the carnal nature of man.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"3"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"6"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 3:3; 1 Cor. 10:6; 1 Pet 2:11; Jude 1: 16."},{"id":"17H.2","text":"The carnal mind and friendship with the world is condemned as being enmity against God and His law.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":8,"verses":"7-8"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":2,"verses":"18"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Rom. 8:7-8; Col. 2:18; James 4:4."},{"id":"17H.3","text":"The lusts of the flesh are contrary to the Spirit (so walk in the Spirit, and you shall not fulfill the lust of the flesh).","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":3,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":8,"verses":"1-2"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"16-17"}],"citation":"John 3:6; Rom. 8:1-2; Gal. 5:16-17."},{"id":"17H.4","text":"Beware that those of a carnal mind do not beguile you.","refs":[{"book":"Colossians","chapter":2,"verses":"8,18"}],"citation":"Col. 2:8, 18."},{"id":"17H.5","text":"Do not to lust after the beauty of women.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":31,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"28"}],"citation":"Job 31:1; Prov. 6:25; Matt. 5:28."},{"id":"17H.6","text":"You are to set your mind on the things of God, and not on the things of men.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":16,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Matt. 16:23."},{"id":"17H.7","text":"A carnal way leads to punishment and abandonment by God.","refs":[{"book":"Numbers","chapter":11,"verses":"4-34"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":78,"verses":"17-31"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":81,"verses":"11-12"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":106,"verses":"14-15"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Num. 11:4-34; Psa. 78:17-31; Psa. 81:11 -12; Psa. 106:14-15; 1 Tim. 6:9."},{"id":"17H.8","text":"Lust produces wars and murder.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"James 4:1-2."},{"id":"17H.9","text":"The cares and pleasures of this world, and lusts of things, pervert and choke one's faith in the word of God.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":13,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":4,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":8,"verses":"14"},{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":4,"verses":"3"},{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"2-5"},{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"16"},{"book":"Jude","chapter":1,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Matt. 13:22; Mark 4:19; Luke 8:14; 2 Tim. 4:3; 2 Pet. 3:2-5; Jude 16, 18."},{"id":"17H.10","text":"Sin rather than good dwells in the flesh (carnal nature) of man.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":7,"verses":"17-20,25"}],"citation":"Rom. 7:17-20, 25."},{"id":"17H.11","text":"The problems of lust from the Bible should serve as examples which are not to be followed.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"6-11"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 10:6-11."},{"id":"17H.12","text":"Lusts, being deceitful, draw and entice men to sin.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"22"},{"book":"James","chapter":1,"verses":"14-14"},{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Eph. 4:22; James 1: 14-14; 2 Pet. 2:18."},{"id":"17H.13","text":"Evil and lust comes from within the heart of men.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":6,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Genesis","chapter":8,"verses":"21"},{"book":"1 Kings","chapter":8,"verses":"38-39"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":15,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":7,"verses":"15,21-22"}],"citation":"Gen. 6:5; Gen. 8:21; 1 Kings 8:38-39; Jer. 17:9; Matt. 15:19; Mark 7:15, 21-22."},{"id":"17H.14","text":"We are not to lust after worldly things or conform to them, for they are of the flesh and not of God.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"2"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":2,"verses":"15-17"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:2; 1 John 2:15-17."},{"id":"17H.15","text":"The grace of God teaches us that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly, righteously, and godly in the present age.","refs":[{"book":"Titus","chapter":2,"verses":"11-12"}],"citation":"Titus 2:11-12."},{"id":"17H.16","text":"Avoid worldly wisdom, for the wisdom of this world is foolishness with God.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"18-19"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 3:18-19."},{"id":"17H.17","text":"The lust of the flesh is condemned as making one wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":2,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Eph. 2:3."},{"id":"17H.18","text":"Those who do the works of the flesh shall not inherit the kingdom of God.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"19-21"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:19-21."},{"id":"17H.19","text":"We should not submit to or obey the lusts of the flesh but rather obey Christ and follow righteousness.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":6,"verses":"11-13"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"13-14"},{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":2,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Rom. 6:11-13; Rom. 13:13-14; 2 Tim. 2:22."}]}